  "properties": {
    "title": "Kiribati administrative and jurisdictional boundaries (long table)",
    "description": "All boundary levels for Kiribati, from the EEZ to the finest published level, stacked in one table (one row per unit per level). Sources: OCHA Office of the Pacific Islands (HDX), \"Kiribati - Subnational Administrative Boundaries (COD-AB) 2020\" (kir-ocha-codab-2020); SPC Statistics for Development Division (SDD) for Kiribati National Statistics Office, \"2018 Kiribati Household Listing administrative boundaries (Island, Village, Enumeration Area)\" (kir-spc-sdd-hhl2018); Pacific Community (SPC), Geoscience, Energy and Maritime Division, \"Global Exclusive Economic Zones (200 Nautical Miles) - Merged Dataset (SPC Pacific Maritime Boundaries)\" (spc-gem-pacific-eez-200nm). Licences (per row in the `license` column): CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, CC-BY-3.0-IGO, CC-BY-4.0. Some rows are used and redistributed by this project under a data-use agreement (CSDR-SPC data use agreement (user-confirmed 2026-11-20)); downstream users are bound by the row's public licence (e.g. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) unless they hold their own agreement. Full provenance and source notes: https://github.com/SustainableDevelopmentReform/pacific-administrative-boundaries/blob/v0.1.0/docs/sources.md#kir-kiribati.",
